# Default-deny: exclude everything, then re-include only build inputs.
**

# Build inputs: root metadata referenced by pyproject.toml, the source package,
# and the local icuhub-schemas package installed alongside it.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!src/**
!packages
!packages/icuhub-schemas
!packages/icuhub-schemas/**

# Explicit exclusions, applied after the allowlist so they win inside it.
# VCS and CI metadata
**/.git
**/.github
**/.gitignore
# Tests, docs, deployment, agent tooling
**/tests
**/docs
**/deploy
**/.claude
**/.cursor
# Secrets and local runtime state
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.run
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# Caches, bytecode, build metadata, and local artifacts
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
**/*.egg
**/build
**/dist
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
